  "constellations": [
    {
      "name": "The Observer Seeking What Is Missing",
      "description": "The maximum number of <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\"><button data-link=\"11360001\">Gradient Beacons</button></span> Mitya can carry is increased to 5. Using the Elemental Skill <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\">Principle: Variable Detection</span> additionally creates 1 <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\">Gradient Beacon</span>.\nWhile the <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\"><button data-link=\"11360002\">Detection Core</button></span> is present, your own active character's CRIT DMG is increased by 40%.\nAdditionally, Mitya regenerates 10 Elemental Energy when a <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\">Gradient Beacon</span> is created. This effect can be triggered once every 8s."
    },
    {
      "name": "The Matter That Slumbers Beyond Inertness",
      "description": "While the <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\"><button data-link=\"11360002\">Detection Core</button></span> is present, all opponents within the <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\">Polestar Field</span> have their <span style=\"color: #99FFFFFF;\">Cryo RES</span> and <span style=\"color: #FFACFFFF;\">Electro RES</span> decreased by 20%.\nAdditionally, if the <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\">Detection Core</span> created is:\n·Steady State: All nearby party members gain 123 Elemental Mastery;\n·Overloaded: Your own active character gains 234 Elemental Mastery."
    },
    {
      "name": "The Knotted String of Invariant Topology",
      "description": "Increases the Level of the Elemental Skill <button data-link-s=\"Principle: Variable Detection\"><span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\">Principle: Variable Detection</span></button> by 3.\nMaximum upgrade level is 15."
    },
    {
      "name": "The Isotopes Born of Decay",
      "description": "<span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\"><button data-link=\"11360002\">Detection Cores</button></span> created by Mitya himself deals 1 instance of <span style=\"color: #FFACFFFF;\">AoE Electro DMG</span> equal to 300% of Mitya's Elemental Mastery to nearby opponents for every 5 <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\"><button data-link=\"11360001\">Gradient Beacons</button></span> consumed while it is on the field. This DMG is considered Stellar-Conduct reaction DMG."
    },
    {
      "name": "The Periodic Law That Orders All",
      "description": "Increases the Level of Normal Attack: <button data-link-s=\"Chain Reaction\"><span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\">Chain Reaction</span></button> by 3.\nMaximum upgrade level is 15."
    },
    {
      "name": "Elemental Transition at the Gate of Reason",
      "description": "<span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\"><button data-link=\"11360002\">Detection Core</button></span> is enhanced. If the <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\">Detection Core</span>:\n · Is in the Steady State: <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\">Detection Core</span> deals 115% of its original DMG.\n· Is Overloaded: There is a 34% chance to create 1 new <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\"><button data-link=\"11360001\">Gradient Beacon</button></span> whenever Mitya consumes a <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\">Gradient Beacon</span> with the <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\"><button data-link=\"11360002\">Detection Core</button></span>.\nAdditionally, Stellar-Conduct reaction DMG dealt by all nearby party members is <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\"><button data-link=\"11190007\">Elevated</button></span> by 20%."
    }
  ],
  "passives": [
    {
      "name": "Baseline Stress Test",
      "description": "The <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\"><button data-link=\"11360002\">Detection Core</button></span> created by the Elemental Skill <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\">Principle: Variable Detection</span> is enhanced. Depending on the state of the <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\">Detection Core</span> created:\n·Steady State: All nearby party members gain 30 Elemental Mastery for each <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\"><button data-link=\"11360001\">Gradient Beacon</button></span> Mitya has;\n·Overloaded: After nearby party members trigger Stellar-Conduct reactions, instead obtain 1 <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\">Gradient Beacon</span> every 1.5s for 6s."
    },
    {
      "name": "Explosive Reagent: Safe Limits Exceeded",
      "description": "The duration of <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\"><button data-link=\"11360001\">Gradient Beacons</button></span> is increased to 10s. Additionally, Mitya's CRIT Rate increases by 5% for 15s after creating a <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\">Gradient Beacon</span>. This effect can stack up to 4 times."
    },
    {
      "name": "Stellar Jubilee: Top-Secret Protocol",
      "description": "When party members trigger Superconduct, it will be changed to Stellar-Conduct. Stellar-Conduct reactions will no longer create <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\">Starlight Prisms</span>, and will instead create 1 <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\"><button data-link=\"11360001\">Gradient Beacon</button></span> nearby every 1.5s for 3s. These Beacons can be carried by Mitya and transform the area around them into an even larger <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\">Polestar Field</span>. Triggering another Stellar-Conduct reaction will refresh the duration of the aforementioned effects.\nAdditionally, the Base Stellar-Conduct DMG dealt by all nearby party members will be increased based on Mitya's Elemental Mastery: Every point of Elemental Mastery he has increases Base Stellar-Conduct DMG by 0.028%. The maximum Base DMG increase that can be gained this way is 14%. While within a <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\">Polestar Field</span>, Mitya will also enter the <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\">Radiance: Stellar-Conduct</span> state."
    },
    {
      "name": "Energy Catalysis",
      "description": "When destructible rocks are nearby, <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\"><button data-link=\"11360002\">Detection Core: Steady State</button></span> can quickly clear them.\nAdditionally, when Mitya is in the party, creating <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\">Prime Ice Construct: Basic Heat Source</span> does not consume Kresnik Energy."
    }
  ],
  "links": {
    "11190007": {
      "title": "Elevation",
      "desc": "Special DMG Boost effect. It is calculated independently of other DMG Boost effects."
    },
    "11360001": {
      "title": "Gradient Beacons",
      "desc": "When Mitya is in the party and a Stellar-Conduct reaction is triggered, a <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\">Gradient Beacon</span> that lasts for 6s will be created instead of a <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\">Starlight Prism</span>. Mitya can consume <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\">Gradient Beacons</span> to trigger various effects.\n<span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\">Gradient Beacons</span> follow the active character and transform a larger nearby area into a <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\">Polestar Field</span> when a <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\">Gradient Beacon</span> is created. Mitya can have multiple <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\">Gradient Beacons</span>, with an initial maximum of 4. Creating a <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\">Gradient Beacon</span> will reset the duration of all <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\">Gradient Beacons</span>."
    },
    "11360002": {
      "title": "Detection Core",
      "desc": "An energy device Mitya creates after using his Elemental Skill. Tapping it creates a Core in <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\">Steady State</span>, while holding it creates an <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\">Overloaded</span> core.\n\n<span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\">Detection Core: Steady State</span>\n·Continuously follows nearby opponents and intermittently deals <span style=\"color: #FFACFFFF;\">AoE Electro DMG</span>;\n·When Mitya has reached the maximum number of <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\">Gradient Beacons</span> he can have, the device will consume any newly generated <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\">Gradient Beacon</span> and deal <span style=\"color: #FFACFFFF;\">AoE Electro DMG</span> that is considered Stellar-Conduct reaction DMG;\n·When its duration ends or another <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\">Detection Core</span> is created, the device will consume all <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\">Gradient Beacons</span> Mitya has and deal <span style=\"color: #FFACFFFF;\">AoE Electro DMG</span> that is considered Stellar-Conduct reaction DMG based on the number consumed.\n\n<span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\">Detection Core: Overloaded</span>\n·While this device is present and Mitya has at least 1 <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\">Gradient Beacon</span>, he can perform the special Charged Attack <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\">Gradient Detonation</span> without consuming Stamina."
    }
  },
