  "attack": {
    "name": "Chain Reaction",
    "description": "<span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\">Normal Attack</span>\nPerforms a maximum of 3 attacks that deal <span style=\"color: #FFACFFFF;\">Electro DMG</span>.\n\n<span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\">Charged Attack</span>\nConsumes a certain amount of Stamina to deal <span style=\"color: #FFACFFFF;\">AoE Electro DMG</span> to the area in front after a short casting time.\nMitya will instead perform the special Charged Attack <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\">Gradient Detonation</span>, which consumes no Stamina, if a <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\"><button data-link=\"11360002\">Detection Core: Overload</button></span> created by Mitya himself is currently on the field and he has at least 1 <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\"><button data-link=\"11360001\">Gradient Beacon</button></span>: Deals 1 instance of <span style=\"color: #FFACFFFF;\">AoE Electro DMG</span> to the area in front and continuously consumes <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\">Gradient Beacons</span> while held. Each <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\">Gradient Beacon</span> consumed deals 1 instance of <span style=\"color: #FFACFFFF;\">AoE Electro DMG</span> to the area in front that is considered Stellar-Conduct reaction DMG.\n\n<span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\">Plunging Attack</span>\nPlunges from mid-air to strike the ground below, damaging opponents along the path and dealing <span style=\"color: #FFACFFFF;\">AoE Electro DMG</span> upon impact.",
    "skillLabels": [
