  "elementalSkill": {
    "name": "Principle: Variable Detection",
    "description": "Conducts a theoretically relatively safe experiment at a theoretically relatively safe yield, dealing <span style=\"color: #FFACFFFF;\">AoE Electro DMG</span> and creating a <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\"><button data-link=\"11360002\">Detection Core</button></span> in different ways depending on whether the Skill is tapped or held.\n\nTapping the Elemental Skill <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\">Principle: Variable Detection</span> again within 6s after using it changes the <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\">Detection Core</span>'s state. The Detection Core's state can be changed in this way every 1.5s.\n\n<i>\"Don't worry! These quantities have been proven safe in test after test... Hm? It blew up? Oh, I forgot to mention: that conclusion was based on ideal experimental conditions.\"</i>",
